Driver for USB Communication Device Class - Abstract Control Model devices.


TBD



!<device name="usb-3-3" class="0x2" manufacturer="Miromico" product="EDGE-GWC-02-LW-868"
!        vendor_id="0x483" product_id="0x5740" speed="full" acquired="true">
!
!	<config active="true" value="0x1">
!		<interface active="true" number="0x0" alt_setting="0x0" class="0x2" subclass="0x2" protocol="0x1">
!			<endpoint address="0x82" attributes="0x3" max_packet_size="0x8"/>
!		</interface>
!
!		<interface active="true" number="0x1" alt_setting="0x0" class="0xa" subclass="0x0" protocol="0x0">
!			<endpoint address="0x1" attributes="0x2" max_packet_size="0x40"/>
!			<endpoint address="0x81" attributes="0x2" max_packet_size="0x40"/>
!		</interface>
!	</config>
!
!</device>

There are two sub devices
 - interface=0x0 alt_setting=0x0 class=0x2 subclass=0x2 protocol=0x1 : CDC-ACM protocol AT
 - interface=0x1 alt_setting=0x0 class=0xa subclass=0x0              : RS-232 over USB
